  "Id": 1909,
  "Title": "Business English: Improve your Communication for Work",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "Effective communication is critical for any organisation.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<p>Effective communication is critical for any organisation. In organisations like AKU which use English in many work-related situations, it has become imperative to be able to communicate effectively through English. Indeed, a high level of English is considered an essential global skill. ELE_net's Business English courses provide you with a great opportunity to develop your English skills for business and work-related purposes.</p><p>We provide a blended learning approach integrating a British Council online course into our face-to-face classes. These classes are very interactive, engaging and, according to our previous course participants, a lot of fun!  <br/></p><p>The language-rich content revolves around introductions and small talks, working with clients, handling feedback, discussing customer relations and networking, understanding different written communication, and giving a  presentation like a pro! You will also improve your pronunciation, fluency and accuracy when speaking in English.</p><p>Get ahead in your career and sign up for an ELE_net Business English course!</p><p><a href=\"/ele-net/staff/Pages/Business_English.aspx\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.aku.edu/ele-net/staff/Pages/Business_English.aspx</a><br/></p>",
